<title>UK: Energy Group proposes 5.5 p/shr interim div.</title>
<headline>Energy Group proposes 5.5 p/shr interim div.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Energy Group, which announced an agreed $9.6 billion takeover offer from PacfiCorp of the U.S. on Friday, said it had proposed an interim dividend of 5.5 pence a share.</p>
<p>The company, due to announce its results on Friday, said the dividend would be paid on July 4, 1997.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
